{
  "title": "Agentic Reasoning and Tool Integration for LLMs via Reinforcement Learning",
  "authors": [
    "Joykirat Singh",
    "Raghav Magazine",
    "Yash Pandya",
    "Akshay Nambi"
  ],
  "year": 2025,
  "arxivId": "2505.01441",
  "abstract": "Large language models (LLMs) can be limited by their reliance on static internal knowledge and text-only reasoning. This work introduces ARTIST, a framework that enables LLMs to reason with and act upon external tools and environments via reinforcement learning, achieving state-of-the-art results in complex mathematical reasoning and multi-turn function calling tasks.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "ARTIST is a framework that combines <strong>agentic reasoning</strong>, <strong>reinforcement learning</strong>, and <strong>tool integration</strong> for LLMs. It enables models to dynamically interact with external tools and environments, making them more effective at solving complex, real-world problems.",
      "visualization": {
