          "yLabel": "Value"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "ARTIST uses a <strong>reinforcement learning algorithm</strong> to train the model, which alternates between <strong>internal reasoning</strong> and <strong>tool interactions</strong>. The model decides when and how to invoke tools, and the tool outputs are incorporated back into the reasoning chain. This process allows the model to learn optimal strategies for leveraging external tools and interacting with complex environments.",
