      "content": "ARTIST achieves state-of-the-art results in complex mathematical reasoning and multi-turn function calling tasks, outperforming baseline models by up to 22% absolute improvement. The results demonstrate the effectiveness of ARTIST in enabling LLMs to solve complex problems that require dynamic, multi-step reasoning and tool use.",
